{"title":"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Students at Gauss Middle School were asked to choose their favourite school day. The results are shown in the circle graph.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Which day was chosen by exactly one-quarter of the students?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff2440094769522cc6d9c171cb90fb928e132dce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{Monday} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{Tuesday} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{Wednesday} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{Thursday} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{Friday}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"620\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c24f7e821feb7439977fa9d1531d15c9eb8014a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} = 0.25 = 25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />, so the day that was picked by exactly one-quarter of the students was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d40bf2456cd5dc7932a598c616cab06691634c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\text{Wednesday}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"129\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b